"""Authoritative cross-platform installer for the Codex v4_flash_worker.

One self-contained raw script (PEP 723) that installs the current Codex-only
payload on a new machine: the use-v4-flash-worker skill (SKILL.md,
agents/openai.yaml, agents/codex_AGENTS_block.md, scripts), the session-scoped
plaintext handoff Hook, the Codex AGENTS routing block, and the Windows UTF-8
shell environment. It also manages the v4_flash_worker agent TOML with DeepSeek
credentials, backs up before every mutation, and supports add / update / backup
/ list-backups / status / restore / remove.

The authoritative payload lives in payload/ in this repository. The raw-script
one-shot path (``uv run <raw-url>``) cannot read payload/ from disk, so the
payload is embedded byte-exact below (regenerated by
scripts/sync_embedded_payload.py); a parity test keeps payload/ and the
embedded copy in lockstep.

Runtime boundary: this installer only ever reads/writes the Codex home
(CODEX_HOME, default ~/.codex) and the backup directory. It never reads or
writes the user agents configuration directory.
"""

